          "reason": "Needed one minimal out-of-scope check to verify whether the worker's 'public form by design' explanation is grounded in shipped plugin code.",
          "outcome": "Opened within the single out-of-band allowance. `SubscriptionFormBlock::data()` prepares the `/hostinger-reach/v1/contact` endpoint and a `wp_rest` nonce at lines 15-18, and `render_block_html()` outputs a public subscription form at lines 63-111."
        }
